  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Transparency and Accountability in Papua New Guinea Project (TAP in PNG)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal of the &#x2018;Transparency and Accountability in Papua New Guinea Project (&#x201c;TAP Project&#x201d;) is to contribute to the improvement of transparency and accountability in the use of public financial resources at the national level in Papua New Guinea (PNG), and particularly in the Autonomous Region of Bougainville (ARB). The Project is funded by the European Union and implemented by the United Nations Development Programme (UNDP).</narrative>
  </description>
